 ng list: ["Ray"\, "Eel"\, "Crab"\, "Turtle"].\n\n* Use append() to add "S
 hark" to the end.\n\n* Use insert() to place "Octopus" at index 1.\n\n* U
 se pop() to remove the item currently at index 2.\n\n* Print the list and
  its length after each change.\n\nSilver Challenge: Translate your three 
 operations into AP pseudocode.\nGold Challenge: Use .copy() to create a s
 eparate list and explain how copying differs from sharing.\nhttps://bcpss
